temFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合红帽与英伟达研发OCE1.0，打造面向AI代理的企业级Kubernetes</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic披露IPO招股书：拟以2万亿美元估值上市，2025年亏损超80亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月将访韩，拟与三星电子敲定HBM4内存供应合作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌向免费用户全面开放Gemini Skills，Gems功能将于11月完成整合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式宣布将此前仅限Pro和Ultra付费订阅用户使用的Gemini Skills自定义指令服务，全面向所有免费账户用户开放。此次调整旨在降低个性化AI工具的使用门槛，提升Gemini在大众消费市场的产品竞争力。伴随此次普及，原有的Gems功能将于2026年11月17日正式整合至升级后的Skills系统中。升级后的Skills优化了底层交互逻辑，用户在主聊天框输入斜杠（/）加指令即可唤醒特定AI技能。对于免费用户，系统支持完整保留既有自定义配置，并可通过专属链接创建新Skills，确保在系统迁移期间实现无缝过渡。此次迭代不仅增强了用户操作的直观性与高效性，也标志着谷歌进一步推动AI定制化能力向更广泛用户群体渗透，通过提升用户粘性巩固平台生态优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软联手哈佛MIT发布生物学世界模型Project Quine，实现抗癌药物快速筛选</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/049dadf42e5f697b56c1bd53c8e01875.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软研究院联合哈佛大学及麻省理工学院博德研究所，正式推出生物学世界模型Project Quine。该系统旨在打通计算生物学建模与实验室湿实验，通过构建覆盖基因组学、蛋白质、化学分子、细胞状态及生物成像的联合表征空间，实现多模态跨领域综合分析。Project Quine的核心优势在于其交互式推理框架，能够解决传统生物学研究中各领域数据难以统一的瓶颈。在实际测试中，该系统展现出极高效率，仅用一个周末即筛选出抗癌候选物，将药物发现与验证周期从数月压缩至数天。目前，微软已启动首届Quine Fellows项目，开放科研人员申请抢先使用该系统，后续计划逐步推进商业化场景应用。这一进展标志着世界模型技术在生命科学领域的深度落地，有望大幅降低药物研发的时间与经济成本，为科研人员提供全新的治疗路径探索工具。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合红帽与英伟达研发OCE1.0，打造面向AI代理的企业级Kubernetes</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI、红帽（Red Hat）与英伟达正联合开发开源智能体框架的企业级版本OpenClaw Enterprise（OCE1.0），旨在解决AI代理在政企环境中的安全与合规难题。该项目由OpenAI内部发起并捐赠给OpenClaw基金会，被定位为“面向代理的Kubernetes”。针对此前OpenClaw因安全机制薄弱被Gartner定性为高风险并遭企业封禁的问题，OCE1.0引入了企业级控制平面，原生支持多租户隔离、严苛安全边界控制及标准化代理原语。该框架提供完善的治理与可审计性，允许企业灵活替换底层模型、框架及沙箱方案。红帽副总裁Joe Fernandes强调，OCE1.0旨在推动智能体从消费端探索转向生产力基础设施，为企业在合规前提下部署高自主性AI提供关键路径，标志着智能体生态进入注重管控的成熟期。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic披露IPO招股书：拟以2万亿美元估值上市，2025年亏损超80亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab7742c19edc16283651a5f2488dbbf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日向合作伙伴披露IPO招股书，计划以约2万亿美元估值推进上市。财务数据显示，公司2025年营收同比增长12倍至46亿美元，其中Claude模型用量计费贡献约38亿美元，订阅业务占比不足20%。同期运营亏损翻倍突破80亿美元，且面临高达546亿美元的不可取消算力托管承诺。在商业生态上，Anthropic对亚马逊和谷歌云依赖加深，2025年通过上述平台实现21.6亿美元收入，营收占比升至47%，并支付3.51亿美元渠道抽成。此外，公司前两大匿名客户贡献了24%的营收但未签署长期协议，且截至2025年底仍有9.09亿美元未付账款。该招股书揭示了头部大模型厂商在规模化扩张过程中，仍面临渠道自主权受限、算力成本刚性承压及客户留存波动等多重挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月将访韩，拟与三星电子敲定HBM4内存供应合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4913ccd3981ba570d2bd86e12ae78ac2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰预计将于10月亲赴韩国，与三星电子高层举行会谈，核心议题聚焦于AI芯片技术合作，重点在于将三星纳入AMD下一代AI加速器HBM4的内存供应链。双方此前于今年3月签署了关于AI存储芯片与计算技术的谅解备忘录，三星当时已被列为HBM4芯片的优先供应商，此次访韩旨在将合作意向转化为正式订单。HBM4作为AI加速器的关键内存层级，其供应稳定性直接决定了AMD未来旗舰芯片的产能与交付节奏。除三星外，苏姿丰此行还计划接触韩国本土NPU企业，意在通过整合内存与专用计算单元，进一步强化AMD在AI算力产业链的布局与掌控力。此次行程标志着AMD正加速构建多元化的供应链版图，以应对高性能AI计算市场对先进存储技术的迫切需求。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
